{
  "doc": "PROFILE.md \u00a74.2: 'The LASzip back-end is gone. `compression` remains an accepted option on `writers.las`, but lazperf is always what compresses; no value of `compression` selects LASzip and no value is an error.' and stages/writers.las.rst: 'Set to \"lazperf\" or \"laszip\" to apply compression to the output, creating a LAZ file instead of an LAS file.'",
